  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Adviser to Support Sierra Leone Agreement on National Unity &#x2013; Alleged Political Prisoners Strand</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A deployable civilian expert will support parties to the Agreement on National Unity to review and resolve alleged cases of politically motivated arrests and detentions. The expert will advise the main opposition and other political parties on how to justify and evidence their claims.</narrative>
  </description>
